680	     * compared case-insensitively - the same way the city is matched when building the
681	     * {@code customerCode} sequence. The count reflects the state prior to this create. A city
682	     * at capacity is reported via {@link CityAtCapacityException}, which the exception handler
683	     * translates to a 409.
684	     */
